WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:05.070
Hey, Priss! What's wrong with you?!

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.560
Hey!

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:36.770
Priss!

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.140
Did you see that too?!

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.840
Anyway, we have to go see Sylia!

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.900
Sylia, what's the matter?!

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:01.070
I heard she collapsed suddenly
and hasn't moved since.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:04.970
Her body temperature and pulse
are rapidly dropping.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.700
I've already called a doctor, but...

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.480
What the hell is this?

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.080
Sotai...

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.670
The Sotai Phenomenon is
beginning to rise rapidly.

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:42.410
The shield's strength is 500 times
greater than that of Wiz Lab,

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:42.840
but we must do something or...

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:43.170
Get the elevator up here.
but we must do something or...

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.500
Get the elevator up here.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:58.320
Galatea is just lonely, I know.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.400
Elevator ascension completed.
Condition, nominal.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.610
What's wrong, Galatea?

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:11.560
You've been calling your friends,
right? But it's too early.

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.800
Too early?

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.570
Yes, it's too early.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:19.430
You're a good girl. You're becoming
more and more clever.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:23.710
I want to show you to Stingray,

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:26.680
who, in his stupidity, tried
to kill your intelligence.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.140
I want to play!

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:31.580
I guess I need to see her power anyway.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.220
I see. You want to play?

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:39.160
Then we need to find a place for you.

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:57.570
Sylia!

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.240
I guess she's calming down.
Sylia!

00:03:58.240 --> 00:03:59.110
I guess she's calming down.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.880
Who's calming down?

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:04.720
The Sotai, my other self, has
been confined somewhere.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.120
She's been bombarding us with
her desire to go outside.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:11.320
What do you mean? What's
the relationship then?

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:13.420
A quasi-living organism,

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:17.630
a nano-mechanism implanted in
her brain when she was little.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:19.290
She's called Sotai?

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.200
In addition to her, I'm one of the failures.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.290
I hate your way of putting that.

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.110
Sylia!

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.740
Sylia, don't move yet!

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.510
Mr. Meisio, Sylia's back!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.070
Thank you, Meisio.

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:42.490
How do you feel now, Miss Sylia?

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:46.890
Horrible of course, since she's
been yelling in my brain.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.390
I'm so relieved, Sylia!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:52.630
Sorry to make you worry, Nene.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:54.360
And the rest of you too.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.900
But I wonder why...

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:59.800
We were also struck by the dream
you were dreaming.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:03.510
We all saw the same image from
your dream. What did that mean?

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:05.940
I see...

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:09.350
Does that mean we all understand each other?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.420
In other words, it wasn't a coincidence for us

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:14.180
to have met and become Knight Sabers, was it?

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.950
If someone calls it a coincidence,
it might have been,

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.920
but it was also inevitable.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:26.890
Before you arrived, I formed
another band of Knight Sabers.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:38.000
At that time, I was young, and I
led the others into the fight.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.410
I scouted other members the
same as I did with you.

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:55.590
A girl who was good at martial arts.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:01.590
An American who used to be in
Special Ops for the Pentagon.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.680
No matter what their fighting abilities were,

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.480
they were too ordinary to fully use the hard suits,

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.510
even though I chose the girls who
had similar shapes to mine.

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:37.100
A hard suit can only maintain its shape

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:40.140
and special functions by
forming to a female body.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:42.010
Because originally, it was a boomer.

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:46.500
I get it. A boomer can only be a
boomer by imitating a human.

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.010
But that means we were...

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.210
I'm sorry not to have told you about it.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:57.890
But the cores I mounted in your
suits were copied from clean ones,

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:01.690
so the hard suits could never have
a mind of their own or move alone.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.130
But why does it have to be female?

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.000
Because I am female.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.930
The hard suit is customized to my body.

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.040
Therefore, at first,

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:17.700
I thought it was proper to choose
girls with bodies similar to mine.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:20.940
But in that case, Nene or I are not...

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:24.180
Well, of course it's better if they can move well,

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.810
but there's something more important than that.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:29.520
What?

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:36.050
I have to have the feeling that
I will really like them.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.560
No way, Sylia!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:44.530
Well, of course I like you,

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:46.730
but it's not something like falling in love or...

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.740
What a weird girl!

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:51.880
But she's right.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:56.810
Hard suits don't just follow the
action synapses of their wearer.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.780
They move with information from
deep inside of the brain

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:02.520
or the emotional part of the person.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:04.920
That's why the person has to get along with me.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:08.460
"Get along" might not be the
proper words to describe it.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.890
In other words, the person's
wavelength matches mine.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:13.260
I see. I was so surprised.

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:18.340
You're selfish. You think you can
get along with us in your own way

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.000
and pretend to let us earn some allowances,

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.340
but actually, you manipulated
us to cheer you up, didn't you?

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:24.540
Yet you made us put on a boomer?!

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.180
I already apologized to you for it.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:29.180
I know you have the most extreme
feelings about boomers...

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:31.010
That's not something for you to discuss!

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.350
I've had more than enough! No more!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.250
Priss!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:42.060
Mackey, can you call Nigel?

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.690
I have to ask him to create new hard suits.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.160
Sure.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.290
It's a boomer, isn't it?

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.040
If you don't like that, you can quit.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.310
Even if I'm all by myself,

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.430
I will deal with Sotai, and smash her core!

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:04.070
I've heard about you. What a guy you are!

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:06.550
What are you talking about?

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:10.250
The rumor has already spread
all over the Totem Pole.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.920
You and the lady singer at Hot
Legs had a midnight rendezvous.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.830
It's not like that!

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.360
Oh, it's not like that? Of course not, right?

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:21.800
No ordinary girl would go out with
someone like you, would she?

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.140
You're serious, aren't you?

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:26.770
I guess I shouldn't reveal another rumor

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.740
to a guy with the mental state
of a mere mortal, should I?

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:32.330
I don't have time to listen to
stupid rumors one by one.

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:36.050
I've heard that all the director
types in the frontline division

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:39.780
were called up to the top management
office this morning.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.860
The AD Police will be merged into
the Normal Police soon,

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:47.020
according to a disgusting story
that leaked out somewhere.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.190
What does it mean?

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:51.530
This place can't survive without
the support of a private business.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:52.860
Do you mean Genom?

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:57.530
Genom doesn't think boomers are
a main part of its business now.

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:00.700
Even so, how can they dump us so easily?!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.610
After all, we're just a waste
disposal team for Genom.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.040
Genom!

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:15.310
Mason, you're hiding something
from me, aren't you?

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.790
What are you talking about?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:23.190
It could cost you your life if you
underestimate this old man.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:29.230
You brought a dangerous thing
into this tower, didn't you?

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.640
It's just an experiment of the
system which transfers

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.570
the beam being sent from the umbrella,

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:38.270
currently under construction
in orbit, into kinetic energy.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:43.210
I'm just concerned about an overflow of energy.

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.580
Please don't worry about it.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.050
I see...

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.880
Mason.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.150
Yes, Chairman Rozenkroitz?

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.190
Do not betray me.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.090
Yes, Sir.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:16.110
Who is it?

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:21.240
Geez. Don't send me e-mail at the office.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.350
Are you doing well at work, Nene?

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.860
That's Ms. Nene!

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:28.480
Can you come to Sylia's
shop after work today?

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:33.060
Sylia is... It's too late for Sylia
to wear the hard suit.

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.970
After someone has matured as a female,

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:37.900
she can't keep the core of the hard suit pure,

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:41.070
because of the functioning of her brain.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:44.070
If you put it that way, then I haven't matured.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:48.770
In order to make a new hard suit,
we need to measure your body.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:52.940
Well, I understand I'm asking you
to do something horrible,

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.150
but I don't want to let Sylia go by herself.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.050
Younger brother?

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:02.690
What? You're still here?

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:06.230
I'm sorry to be here, but I don't have a choice.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.800
No, that's not true. You didn't know, did you?

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:11.870
This afternoon, everybody
has to leave the office.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.000
What do you mean?

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:17.270
It's a strike. The AD Police will be
merged into the Normal Police.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.810
You aren't a member of the union, are you?

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:23.180
No. I don't like things like that very much.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.340
Then you can do whatever,
including go home for half a day.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:35.090
Why don't you go out with your
boyfriend? If you have one.

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:37.960
How rude you are!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.460
What shall I do? A new hard suit?

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.810
You're a member of the union, aren't you?

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:56.510
There's a penalty if you stay here, isn't there?

00:12:56.510 --> 00:13:01.250
I don't care. Just for once, tell me the truth, Nick.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.320
Is the AD Police going to be dissolved?

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.460
I've heard there's a rumor like that.

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:07.560
Is it just a rumor?

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:11.820
A rumor contains some truth once in a while.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:14.730
I see.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.730
I didn't say anything.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:20.600
Sure, I understood your words in my own way.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:22.230
Leon McNichol.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:24.970
You've been a good frontline officer.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:27.480
You can go back to the normal
police triumphantly.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:30.180
I applied here because I hated it there.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:31.780
I don't intend to go back there at all.

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:35.820
An excellent policeman can
only live as a policeman.

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:37.620
Where is the evidence to prove that?

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:40.180
I guess you're sure.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.830
I feel the same as you.

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.800
What are you going to do, Nene?

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.970
Well, do you have any suggestions?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.370
I don't know.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.540
You're a man, aren't you?

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.370
You should decide what to do
by yourself, shouldn't you?

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:01.610
I guess so. I have to decide by myself.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:05.040
I wonder if Linna ever goes there or not?

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:07.450
I guess Priss doesn't go.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:23.000
What the hell is happening?!
Nothing is coming in!

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:29.630
What the hell's going on?!

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:36.510
What?

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:37.980
No way!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:48.090
Am I the only one left in this building?!

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:49.560
I just can't be!

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:55.530
Hey!

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:57.630
Director!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:00.170
You're an operator in the
information center, aren't you?

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.640
What's happening now?

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:04.340
Well, even though there's no sign of anything,

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.080
our protection system has initiated itself.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:10.150
Ridiculous! Is the system here that stupid?!

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:14.020
No way! If an error occurs, this
system can correct it by itself!

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:16.320
It's a waste of time to argue about it here.

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:19.520
If the alarm is telling us the truth,
we shouldn't be here.

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.960
What happened?

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:24.760
Excuse me!

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:25.460
Hey, you!
Excuse me!

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:26.260
Hey, you!
I'm going back to the Center and investigate!

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:26.960
I'm going back to the Center and investigate!

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:31.970
What just appeared?

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.440
Underground...

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:35.430
What the hell are you?!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.970
Boomers?

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.440
No way!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.960
What the hell is going on?!

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:59.360
Why are there so many boomers underground?

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:03.570
It's the warehouse. Mad boomers
recovered by frontline officers.

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:06.040
Why did they revive?

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.740
I don't know.

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.500
Anyway, we have to stop them here.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:21.980
Dragon Lines K-24, R-34 and
Y-133 have been closed.

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:28.290
The area affected by the phenomenon is
spreading along the Dragon Line.

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.620
It's not contamination.

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:34.650
Galatea's phenomenon is allowing
boomers to show their true self.

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:42.940
Good. The experiment is over.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:46.000
The contaminated area has penetrated the wall.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:50.250
I guess you never would have
thought that the Dragon Line

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:52.650
would be used for a purpose
like this, right, Chairman?

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.710
How is the Totem Pole?

00:16:57.650 --> 00:17:01.090
The boomers stored in the
warehouse are reviving.

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:09.900
I don't think the striking workers
need a home to return to.

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:16.130
We need not do anything. The
boomers will do what they want.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.050
What's wrong, Sylia?

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:37.550
She's shouting in my mind again.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:39.800
This isn't good.

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:43.800
The phenomenon seems to be recurring.

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:56.630
Boomers are not just a tool to serve humans.

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:58.820
You...

00:17:58.820 --> 00:17:59.450
Yes, Galatea. Someone named
you Galatea, didn't he?
You...

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:02.510
Yes, Galatea. Someone named
you Galatea, didn't he?

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:07.050
Hold yourself together, Mackey!
You are not a boomer!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.760
I... I'm not a human either.

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:12.900
You are yourself!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.360
I...

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:21.000
Nene's in danger!

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.220
We're finished!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.690
Back off!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:54.540
Run!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.890
They're endless!

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:15.430
Nene Romanova, place emergency
calls to all frontline officers

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:17.660
and request the Normal Police to help!

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:20.060
I've already tried that, but I can't contact them.

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:22.700
All the outside circuits have been cut.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:26.500
I know. When someone attacks headquarters,

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:30.560
the highest level firewall engages automatically.

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.680
Damn! They're coming this way too!

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:37.780
That firewall will be broken soon!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.300
This way! Hurry!

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.050
Director, hurry and get up here!

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.350
You can't stay there any longer!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.700
I guess you're right. Is there
anybody left in this building?

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:56.430
I ran an ID search, but there's nobody except us.

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:16.790
There are many calls, but AD
Police Headquarters is closed

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:18.990
and its communications with
the outside world cut.

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:22.590
The AD Police Union is on strike today

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:24.090
and nobody should be inside the building.

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:25.720
This looks good.

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:30.900
What the hell is that?

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:34.430
What was that?

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:39.740
This is Linna Yamazaki.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.840
Nene's in danger! Help Nene!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.010
What?!

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:46.120
Nene is locked up in the Totem Pole.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:49.320
There are countless boomers in there!

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:50.790
I got you!

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:54.590
But we don't have any hard suits!

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:58.360
Next Episode

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:02.990
Zombie boomers suddenly attack
the AD Police building

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:05.410
which is short on personnel
because of the strike.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.410
As their numbers rapidly increase,

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.870
we are gradually cornered!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.540
Neither Priss, Leon or the others
are aware of this situation.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:18.920
What the hell is this?! I'm surrounded by them!

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:21.510
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
